{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.poster.avif?t=1767692290\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.webm?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.mp4?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fastest place to get the latest DODORI news! Come join us on DISCORD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/b46b11a31d647c1e0681ace74c428f77.avif?t=1767692290\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.poster.avif?t=1767692290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.webm?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.mp4?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/9332508aa7a0962d814a58b007179555.avif?t=1767692290\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Sowoon High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.poster.avif?t=1767692290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.webm?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.mp4?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8592f3976a0c4409d56ffc493d152885.avif?t=1767692290\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, eating a gigantic pudding is a very important task that requires concentration, though! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more diverse and cute events prepared, so don't miss out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.poster.avif?t=1767692290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.webm?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.mp4?t=1767692290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong>\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All I See Is Sara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/00d01ef5cf76aa596b6eacf2817bd9f5f097adf7.jpg"},{"name":"All I See Is Sara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/81eed9523bf13696587e112944a02c9e2949c0dc.jpg"},{"name":"Where the Band Began","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/0451fdea67a41dc3d31deeda719e47235f63a368.jpg"},{"name":"Spring and Summer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/5e32c020ccec18243745aab413cf0bfe852b877c.jpg"},{"name":"To Overcome Stage Fright\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/e95791e18c8347577b15fb1229ea4f3466ecea5f.jpg"},{"name":" I'm on a Roll!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/9b99ff8c6aab1974d9f71ab4a5963277df3820a6.jpg"},{"name":"Sion Cat\u2019s Life Split in Two: Before and After the Band\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/e9055332b4f3e5f67cf7d34f483ed88b20f8a924.jpg"},{"name":"Catch the Snack Thief!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/c1bb36649612235604ad0a051f42a15dba8b7cd8.jpg"},{"name":"Soun Village\u2019s Cherry Blossom Spot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/832b33bb0e9b7d72726c3f11e3df2b09f1123aec.jpg"},{"name":"Autumn and Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2903240/92c16cd06b483357ad12e29d3af48ef1fbc831ac.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903240?t=1767692290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/e67192160721731af23dcdd00114efef261c3034/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767692290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/d7eb9999bce78e9f113a3909f885f5d98c7fd5b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767692290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/d7eb9999bce78e9f113a3909f885f5d98c7fd5b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767692290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.poster.avif?t=1767692290\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.webm?t=1767692290\" typ